{
  "info": {
    "name": "Api-Hubspot",
    "description": "Puente entre alianzas externas y HubSpot CRM.\n\n## Antes de correr\n1. Setear `baseUrl` (default http://localhost:3001).\n2. Setear `apiKey` con la key de la alianza a probar. Necesita scope `leads` para POST /leads y `stats`/`contacts` para los GET de reporting.\n3. `apiKeyInternal` solo si tenes una key con scope `internal`.\n\n## OJO\nLos POST /leads **crean registros reales en el HubSpot de produccion** (contactos, empresas y deals). Los emails de prueba son estables, asi que reejecutar actualiza el mismo contacto/empresa pero **crea un deal nuevo cada vez**.\n\nLas keys no se guardan en este archivo: son variables de coleccion vacias.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKeyInternal",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "dealId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ],
              "query": []
            },
            "description": "Sin auth."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. POST /leads - altas OK (crean datos reales)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "AUTO - persona",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/leads",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "leads"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contact\": {\n    \"email\": \"test.persona@apitest.com\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Juan\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Perez\",\n    \"dni\": \"30123456\",\n    \"phone\": \"+541155550001\",\n    \"whatsappPhone\": \"+541155550001\",\n    \"country\": \"Argentina\",\n    \"state\": \"Buenos Aires\",\n    \"city\": \"La Plata\",\n    \"zip\": \"1900\"\n  },\n  \"deal\": {\n    \"tipoRiesgo\": \"AUTO\",\n    \"details\": {\n      \"marca\": \"Ford\",\n      \"modelo\": \"Focus\",\n      \"version\": \"SE 1.6\",\n      \"anio\": \"2020\",\n      \"numeroMotor\": \"MOT123456\",\n      \"numeroChasis\": \"CHA987654\",\n      \"es0km\": false,\n      \"patente\": \"AB123CD\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Flujo historico. Upsert de Contact por email + deal en etapa \"Nuevo\"."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve deal.id', () => pm.expect(b.deal.id).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('dealId', b.deal.id);",
                  "pm.test('stage Nuevo', () => pm.expect(b.deal.stage).to.eql('Nuevo'));",
                  "pm.test('devuelve contact, no company', () => { pm.expect(b.contact).to.be.an('object'); pm.expect(b.company).to.be.undefined; });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
